<title>CANADA: A&amp;A Foods director sells controlling shares.</title>
<headline>A&amp;A Foods director sells controlling shares.</headline>
<dateline>PORT COQUITLAM, B.C. 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>A&amp;A Foods Ltd said Thursday that CK&amp;G Management Ltd agreed to sell its shares representing the &quot;control base&quot; of A&amp;A to a private corporation.</p>
<p>The company did not disclose the terms of the transaction, but said CK&amp;G Management is a private company controlled by one of its directors.</p>
</text>
